  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fostering science-based and participatory governance processes to face marin litter in Brazil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports the development of tools and a strategic plan to monitor and combat marine litter in a number of coastal states in Brazil, also potentially to include neighbouring countries in the region. The project will foster science-based and participatory governance processes to raise awarness and secure committment to monitor and tackle marine litter at political level as well as within academia/ research institutions, NGOs and with the civil society.</narrative>
  </description>
